WHAT THIS LICENCE DOES *NOT* COVER
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The licence above covers the code and the original artwork in this repository.
It does NOT cover:

  * "world.execute(me);" — the song by Mili. All rights in the recording and
    the composition remain with Mili and their label. This project is an
    unauthorised, non-commercial fan re-interpretation; it ships without the
    audio, and nothing here grants you any right to the music.

  * The lyrics, as quoted in assets/pv-data.js. They appear for the purpose of
    timing the visuals to the vocal line. All rights remain with the author.

  * Country outlines in assets/pv-geo.js, derived from Natural Earth, which is
    in the public domain (https://www.naturalearthdata.com/about/terms-of-use/).

If you are a rights holder and would like something here changed or removed,
please open an issue and it will be dealt with promptly.
